# <%= current_page.data.title %>

The GOV.UK Content API is owned and maintained by the Government Digital Service
(GDS).​

If you have a problem or question about the GOV.UK Content API:

- [Raise a ticket with GOV.UK Support][] if you work for a UK government department
- [Contact GOV.UK][] with your query if you do not

[Raise a ticket with GOV.UK Support]: https://support.publishing.service.gov.uk
[Contact GOV.UK]: https://www.gov.uk/contact/govuk
